     1	# HevSocks5Tunnel
     2	
     3	[![status](https://github.com/heiher/hev-socks5-tunnel/actions/workflows/build.yaml/badge.svg?branch=main&event=push)](https://github.com/heiher/hev-socks5-tunnel)
     4	
     5	A simple, lightweight tunnel over Socks5 proxy (tun2socks).
     6	
     7	## Features
     8	
     9	* IPv4/IPv6. (dual stack)
    10	* Redirect TCP connections.
    11	* Redirect UDP packets. (Fullcone NAT, UDP-in-UDP and UDP-in-TCP [^1])
    12	* Linux/Android/FreeBSD/macOS/iOS/Windows.
    13	
    14	## Benchmarks
    15	
    16	See [here](https://github.com/heiher/hev-socks5-tunnel/wiki/Benchmarks) for more details.
    17	
    18	### Speed
    19	
    20	![](https://github.com/heiher/hev-socks5-tunnel/wiki/res/upload-speed.png)
    21	![](https://github.com/heiher/hev-socks5-tunnel/wiki/res/download-speed.png)
    22	
    23	### CPU usage
    24	
    25	![](https://github.com/heiher/hev-socks5-tunnel/wiki/res/upload-cpu.png)
    26	![](https://github.com/heiher/hev-socks5-tunnel/wiki/res/download-cpu.png)
    27	
    28	### Memory usage
    29	
    30	![](https://github.com/heiher/hev-socks5-tunnel/wiki/res/upload-mem.png)
    31	![](https://github.com/heiher/hev-socks5-tunnel/wiki/res/download-mem.png)
    32	
    33	## How to Build
    34	
    35	### Unix
    36	
    37	```bash
    38	git clone --recursive https://github.com/heiher/hev-socks5-tunnel
    39	cd hev-socks5-tunnel
    40	make
    41	```
    42	
    43	### Android
    44	
    45	```bash
    46	mkdir hev-socks5-tunnel
    47	cd hev-socks5-tunnel
    48	git clone --recursive https://github.com/heiher/hev-socks5-tunnel jni
    49	ndk-build
    50	```
    51	
    52	### iOS and macOS
    53	
    54	```bash
    55	git clone --recursive https://github.com/heiher/hev-socks5-tunnel
    56	cd hev-socks5-tunnel
    57	# will generate HevSocks5Tunnel.xcframework
    58	./build-apple.sh
    59	```
    60	
    61	### Windows (MSYS2)
    62	```bash
    63	export MSYS=winsymlinks:native
    64	git clone --recursive https://github.com/heiher/hev-socks5-tunnel
    65	cd hev-socks5-tunnel
    66	make
    67	```
    68	
    69	### Library
    70	
    71	```bash
    72	git clone --recursive https://github.com/heiher/hev-socks5-tunnel
    73	cd hev-socks5-tunnel
    74	
    75	# Static library
    76	make static
    77	
    78	# Shared library
    79	make shared
    80	```
    81	
    82	## How to Use
    83	
    84	### Config
    85	
    86	```yaml
    87	tunnel:
    88	  # Interface name
    89	  name: tun0
    90	  # Interface MTU
    91	  mtu: 8500
    92	  # Multi-queue
    93	  multi-queue: false
    94	  # IPv4 address
    95	  ipv4: 198.18.0.1
    96	  # IPv6 address
    97	  ipv6: 'fc00::1'
    98	  # Post up script
    99	# post-up-script: up.sh
   100	  # Pre down script
   101	# pre-down-script: down.sh
   102	
   103	socks5:
   104	  # Socks5 server port
   105	  port: 1080
   106	  # Socks5 server address (ipv4/ipv6)
   107	  address: 127.0.0.1
   108	  # Socks5 UDP relay mode (tcp|udp)
   109	  udp: 'udp'
   110	  # Override the UDP address provided by the Socks5 server (ipv4/ipv6)
   111	# udp-address: ''
   112	  # Socks5 handshake using pipeline mode
   113	# pipeline: false
   114	  # Socks5 server username
   115	# username: 'username'
   116	  # Socks5 server password
   117	# password: 'password'
   118	  # Socket mark
   119	# mark: 0
   120	  # TCP fastopen
   121	# tcp-fastopen: false
   122	
   123	#mapdns:
   124	  # Mapped DNS address
   125	# address: 198.18.0.2
   126	  # Mapped DNS port
   127	# port: 53
   128	  # Mapped IP network base
   129	# network: 100.64.0.0
   130	  # Mapped IP network mask
   131	# netmask: 255.192.0.0
   132	  # Mapped DNS cache size
   133	# cache-size: 10000
   134	
   135	#misc:
   136	  # task stack size (bytes)
   137	# task-stack-size: 86016
   138	  # tcp buffer size (bytes)
   139	# tcp-buffer-size: 65536
   140	  # udp socket recv buffer (SO_RCVBUF) size (bytes)
   141	# udp-recv-buffer-size: 524288
   142	  # number of udp buffers in splice, 1500 bytes per buffer.
   143	# udp-copy-buffer-nums: 10
   144	  # maximum session count (0: unlimited)
   145	# max-session-count: 0
   146	  # connect timeout (ms)
   147	# connect-timeout: 10000
   148	  # TCP read-write timeout (ms)
   149	# tcp-read-write-timeout: 300000
   150	  # UDP read-write timeout (ms)
   151	# udp-read-write-timeout: 60000
   152	  # stdout, stderr or file-path
   153	# log-file: stderr
   154	  # debug, info, warn or error
   155	# log-level: warn
   156	  # If present, run as a daemon with this pid file
   157	# pid-file: /run/hev-socks5-tunnel.pid
   158	  # If present, set rlimit nofile; else use default value
   159	# limit-nofile: 65535
   160	```
   161	
   162	### Run
   163	
   164	#### Linux
   165	
   166	```bash
   167	# Set socks5.mark = 438
   168	bin/hev-socks5-tunnel conf/main.yml
   169	
   170	# Disable reverse path filter
   171	sudo sysctl -w net.ipv4.conf.all.rp_filter=0
   172	sudo sysctl -w net.ipv4.conf.tun0.rp_filter=0
   173	
   174	# Bypass upstream socks5 server
   175	sudo ip rule add fwmark 438 lookup main pref 10
   176	sudo ip -6 rule add fwmark 438 lookup main pref 10
   177	
   178	# Route others
   179	sudo ip route add default dev tun0 table 20
   180	sudo ip rule add lookup 20 pref 20
   181	sudo ip -6 route add default dev tun0 table 20
   182	sudo ip -6 rule add lookup 20 pref 20
   183	```
   184	
   185	#### FreeBSD/macOS
   186	
   187	```zsh
   188	# Bypass upstream socks5 server
   189	# 10.0.0.1: socks5 server
   190	# 10.0.2.2: default gateway
   191	sudo route add -net 10.0.0.1/32 10.0.2.2
   192	
   193	# Route others
   194	sudo route change -inet default -interface tun0
   195	sudo route change -inet6 default -interface tun0
   196	```
   197	
   198	#### Windows
   199	
   200	```zsh
   201	# Bypass upstream socks5 server
   202	# 10.0.0.1: socks5 server
   203	# 10.0.2.2: default gateway
   204	route add 10.0.0.1/32 10.0.2.2
   205	
   206	# Route others
   207	route change 0.0.0.0/0 0.0.0.0 if tun-index
   208	route change ::/0 :: if tun-index
   209	```
   210	
   211	#### OpenWrt 24.10+
   212	
   213	Repo: https://github.com/openwrt/packages/tree/master/net/hev-socks5-tunnel
   214	
   215	```sh
   216	# Install package
   217	opkg install hev-socks5-tunnel
   218	
   219	# Edit /etc/config/hev-socks5-tunnel
   220	
   221	# Restart service
   222	/etc/init.d/hev-socks5-tunnel restart
   223	```
   224	
   225	#### Low memory usage
   226	
   227	On low-memory systems like iOS, reducing the size of the TCP buffer and
   228	task stack, as well as limiting the maximum session count, can help prevent
   229	out-of-memory issues.
   230	
   231	```yaml
   232	misc:
   233	  # task stack size (bytes)
   234	  task-stack-size: 24576 # 20480 + tcp-buffer-size
   235	  # tcp buffer size (bytes)
   236	  tcp-buffer-size: 4096
   237	  # maximum session count
   238	  max-session-count: 1200
   239	```
   240	
   241	#### Docker Compose
   242	
   243	```yaml
   244	version: "3.9"
   245	
   246	services:
   247	  client:
   248	    image: alpine:latest # just for network testing
   249	    tty: true # you can test network in terminal
   250	    depends_on:
   251	      tun:
   252	        condition: service_healthy
   253	    network_mode: "service:tun"
   254	
   255	  tun:
   256	    image: ghcr.io/heiher/hev-socks5-tunnel:latest # `latest` for the latest published version; `nightly` for the latest source build; `vX.Y.Z` for the specific version 
   257	    cap_add:
   258	      - NET_ADMIN # needed
   259	    devices:
   260	      - /dev/net/tun:/dev/net/tun # needed
     1	#!/bin/bash
     2	
     3	set -e
     4	
     5	XCFRAMEWORK_DIR="./apple_xcframework"
     6	LIB_NAME="HevSocks5Tunnel"
     7	
     8	# buildStatic iphoneos -mios-version-min=15.0 arm64
     9	buildStatic()
    10	{
    11	     echo "build for $1, $2, min version $3"
    12	
    13	     local MIN_VERSION="-m$1-version-min=$3"
    14	     make PP="xcrun --sdk $1 --toolchain $1 clang" \
    15	          CC="xcrun --sdk $1 --toolchain $1 clang" \
    16	          CFLAGS="-arch $2 $MIN_VERSION" \
    17	          LFLAGS="-arch $2 $MIN_VERSION -Wl,-Bsymbolic-functions" static
    18	
    19	     local OUTPUT_DIR="$XCFRAMEWORK_DIR/$1-$2"
    20	     mkdir -p $OUTPUT_DIR
    21	     local OUTPUT_ARCH_FILE="$OUTPUT_DIR/libhev-socks5-tunnel.a"
    22	
    23	     libtool -static -o $OUTPUT_ARCH_FILE \
    24	                   bin/libhev-socks5-tunnel.a \
    25	                   third-part/lwip/bin/liblwip.a \
    26	                   third-part/yaml/bin/libyaml.a \
    27	                   third-part/hev-task-system/bin/libhev-task-system.a
    28	     make clean
    29	}
    30	
    31	mergeStatic()
    32	{
    33	     echo "merge for $1, $2, $3"
    34	     local FIRST_LIB_FILE="$XCFRAMEWORK_DIR/$1-$2/libhev-socks5-tunnel.a"
    35	     local SECOND_LIB_FILE="$XCFRAMEWORK_DIR/$1-$3/libhev-socks5-tunnel.a"
    36	     local OUTPUT_DIR="$XCFRAMEWORK_DIR/$1-$2-$3"
    37	     mkdir -p $OUTPUT_DIR
    38	     local OUTPUT_ARCH_FILE="$OUTPUT_DIR/libhev-socks5-tunnel.a"
    39	     lipo -create \
    40	          -arch $2 $FIRST_LIB_FILE \
    41	          -arch $3 $SECOND_LIB_FILE \
    42	          -output $OUTPUT_ARCH_FILE
    43	}
    44	
    45	rm -rf $XCFRAMEWORK_DIR
    46	rm -rf HevSocks5Tunnel.xcframework
    47	mkdir $XCFRAMEWORK_DIR
    48	
    49	buildStatic iphoneos arm64 15.0
    50	buildStatic iphonesimulator x86_64 15.0
    51	buildStatic iphonesimulator arm64 15.0
    52	mergeStatic iphonesimulator x86_64 arm64
    53	
    54	# keep same with flutter
    55	buildStatic macosx x86_64 10.14
    56	buildStatic macosx arm64 10.14
    57	mergeStatic macosx x86_64 arm64
    58	
    59	buildStatic appletvos arm64 17.0
    60	buildStatic appletvsimulator x86_64 17.0
    61	buildStatic appletvsimulator arm64 17.0
    62	mergeStatic appletvsimulator x86_64 arm64
    63	
    64	INCLUDE_DIR="$XCFRAMEWORK_DIR/include"
    65	mkdir -p $INCLUDE_DIR/$LIB_NAME
    66	cp ./src/hev-main.h $INCLUDE_DIR/$LIB_NAME
    67	cp ./module.modulemap $INCLUDE_DIR/$LIB_NAME
    68	xcodebuild -create-xcframework \
    69	    -library ./apple_xcframework/iphoneos-arm64/libhev-socks5-tunnel.a -headers $INCLUDE_DIR \
    70	    -library ./apple_xcframework/iphonesimulator-x86_64-arm64/libhev-socks5-tunnel.a -headers $INCLUDE_DIR \
    71	    -library ./apple_xcframework/macosx-x86_64-arm64/libhev-socks5-tunnel.a -headers $INCLUDE_DIR \
    72	    -library ./apple_xcframework/appletvos-arm64/libhev-socks5-tunnel.a -headers $INCLUDE_DIR \
    73	    -library ./apple_xcframework/appletvsimulator-x86_64-arm64/libhev-socks5-tunnel.a -headers $INCLUDE_DIR \
    74	    -output ./HevSocks5Tunnel.xcframework
    75	
    76	rm -rf ./apple_xcframework

