   159	
   160	## UDP in TCP
   161	
   162	UDP-in-TCP mode is a proprietary extension based on RFC 1928, designed to
   163	forward UDP packets within the primary SOCKS5 TCP stream. The protocol is
   164	defined as follows:
   165	
   166	### SOCKS5 Requests
   167	
   168	```
   169	    +----+-----+-------+------+----------+----------+
   170	    |VER | CMD |  RSV  | ATYP | DST.ADDR | DST.PORT |
   171	    +----+-----+-------+------+----------+----------+
   172	    | 1  |  1  | X'00' |  1   | Variable |    2     |
   173	    +----+-----+-------+------+----------+----------+
   174	```
   175	
   176	* CMD
   177	    * UDP IN TCP: X'05'
   178	
   179	### UDP Relays
   180	
   181	```
   182	    +--------+--------+------+----------+----------+----------+
   183	    | MSGLEN | HDRLEN | ATYP | DST.ADDR | DST.PORT |   DATA   |
   184	    +--------+--------+------+----------+----------+----------+
   185	    |   2    |   1    |  1   | Variable |    2     | Variable |
   186	    +--------+--------+------+----------+----------+----------+
   187	```
   188	
   189	- MSGLEN: The total length of the UDP relay message. `[MSGLEN, DATA]`
   190	- HDRLEN: The header length of the UDP relay message. `[MSGLEN, DST.PORT]`
   191	- ATYPE/DST.ADDR/DST.PORT: Fields follow the definitions specified in RFC 1928.
   192	
   193	## Users
   194	
   195	* **HevSocks5Server** - https://github.com/heiher/hev-socks5-server
   196	* **HevSocks5TProxy** - https://github.com/heiher/hev-socks5-tproxy
   197	* **HevSocks5Tunnel** - https://github.com/heiher/hev-socks5-tunnel
   198	
   199	## Contributors
   200	* **hev** - https://hev.cc
   201	* **spider84** - https://github.com/spider84
   202	
