   227	
   228	#### Low memory usage
   229	
   230	On low-memory systems like iOS, reducing the size of the TCP buffer and
   231	task stack, as well as limiting the maximum session count, can help prevent
   232	out-of-memory issues.
   233	
   234	```yaml
   235	misc:
   236	  # task stack size (bytes)
   237	  task-stack-size: 24576 # 20480 + tcp-buffer-size
   238	  # tcp buffer size (bytes)
   239	  tcp-buffer-size: 4096
   240	  # maximum session count
   241	  max-session-count: 1200
   242	```
